{"id":"weisheit","lemma":"Weisheit","pos":"noun","rank":3104,"glosses":["wisdom","insight","wise saying, wise words"],"ipa":"/ˈvaɪ̯shaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8d/De-Weisheit.ogg/De-Weisheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Weisheit","plural":"Weisheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Weisheit kommt mit dem Alter.","en":"Wisdom comes with age.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"age, old age"}]},{"text":"Weisheit gibt uns Macht.","en":"Wisdom gives us power.","words":[null,{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Weisheit ist besser als Reichtum.","en":"Wisdom is better than riches.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"wealth, richness"}]},{"text":"Mit der Zeit wächst die Weisheit.","en":"As time passes, wisdom increases.","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to grow","l":"wachsen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Logik ist der Anfang aller Weisheit, nicht das Ende.","en":"Logic is the beginning of wisdom, not the end.","words":[{"g":"logic"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"start"},{"g":"all","l":"all"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"end, finish"}]}]}